/// ProviderWorkerSup — an app supervisor with one `ProviderWorker` child,
/// as the `ProviderWorker` class comment shows. Its start args (`self
/// args`) are the worker's: `#{#issuer => ..., #options => ...}`.
Supervisor subclass: ProviderWorkerSup

  childSpecs =>
    #(((ProviderWorker supervisionSpecFor: self args) withId: #provider withRestart: #permanent))
